<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About ioir - Our Story</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="logo.png" type="image/x-icon">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div id="page-loader">
        <div class="loader-bar"></div>
    </div>

    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="logo">
                <img src="logo.png" alt="ioira Logo">
            </div>
            <nav>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                    <li><a href="watches.html">Watches</a></li>
                    <li><a href="clothing.html">Clothing</a></li>
                    <li><a href="bracelets.html">Bracelets</a></li>
                    <li><a href="rings.html">Rings</a></li>
                    <li><a href="about.html" class="active">About</a></li>
                    <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>About ioir</h1>
            <p>Crafting the future of wearable essentials</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-content">
                <h2>Our Philosophy</h2>
                <p>ioira was founded on the belief that true luxury lies in the harmony of form and function. We create wearables that are not merely accessories, but essential tools for modern living—each piece engineered to enhance your daily experience while making a subtle statement of refined taste.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-content">
                <h2>Craftsmanship</h2>
                <p>Every ioir product begins with meticulous research and ends with exacting standards. We partner with specialized artisans and manufacturers who share our commitment to quality, using only the finest materials and most advanced techniques available.</p>
                <p>From the Swiss movements in our watches to the technical fabrics in our clothing, each component is selected for its performance, durability, and aesthetic qualities. Our quality control process ensures that every item leaving our workshop meets our uncompromising standards.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-content">
                <h2>Design Approach</h2>
                <p>Our design process strips away the unnecessary to reveal the essential. We believe that good design should be felt rather than noticed—comfortable to wear, intuitive to use, and timeless in appearance. This minimalist approach allows the quality of materials and precision of craftsmanship to speak for themselves.</p>
                <p>We draw inspiration from architecture, industrial design, and the natural world, translating these influences into wearables that feel both contemporary and enduring.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="values">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Our Values</h2>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="skeleton-loader">
                        <div class="skeleton-text">
                            <div class="skeleton-line"></div>
                            <div class="skeleton-line"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Quality</h3>
                    <p>We never compromise on materials or construction</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="skeleton-loader">
                        <div class="skeleton-text">
                            <div class="skeleton-line"></div>
                            <div class="skeleton-line"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Simplicity</h3>
                    <p>Essential forms, refined execution</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="skeleton-loader">
                        <div class="skeleton-text">
                            <div class="skeleton-line"></div>
                            <div class="skeleton-line"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Function</h3>
                    <p>Beauty that serves a purpose</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="skeleton-loader">
                        <div class="skeleton-text">
                            <div class="skeleton-line"></div>
                            <div class="skeleton-line"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Longevity</h3>
                    <p>Made to last, both in style and durability</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-content">
                <div class="footer-logo">
                    <img src="logo.png" alt="ioira Logo">
                </div>
                <div class="footer-links">
                    <h4>Quick Links</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="watches.html">Watches</a></li>
                        <li><a href="clothing.html">Clothing</a></li>
                        <li><a href="bracelets.html">Bracelets</a></li>
                        <li><a href="rings.html">Rings</a></li>
                        <li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
                        <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-contact">
                    <h4>Contact Us</h4>
                    <p>info@ioira.com</p>
                    <p>follow us:</p>
                    <div class="social-links">
                        <a href="#">Instagram</a>
                        <a href="#">Twitter</a>
                        <a href="#">Facebook</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-bottom">
                <p>&copy; 2026 ioir. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        // Page loader simulation
        window.addEventListener('load', function() {
            const loader = document.getElementById('page-loader');
            setTimeout(() => {
                loader.style.opacity = '0';
                setTimeout(() => {
                    loader.style.display = 'none';
                }, 300);
            }, 1500);
        });

        // Skeleton loader replacement with actual content after delay
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            const skeletons = document.querySelectorAll('.skeleton-loader');
            skeletons.forEach((skeleton, index) => {
                setTimeout(() => {
                    skeleton.innerHTML = ''; // Just remove the skeleton, keep the content
                }, 500 + (index * 200));
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>